.Dd November 14, 2026
.Dt SOJACTL 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm sojactl
.Nd manage a running instance of the soja IRC bouncer
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl config Ar path
.Ar command ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
sojactl sends a \fIBouncerServ\fP command to a running soja instance.
See the \fIIRC SERVICE\fP section in \fBsoja\fP(1) for more information.
.Pp
sojactl requires a \fIlisten unix+admin://\fP directive in the soja configuration file. sojactl needs to be run with write permissions on the soja admin socket.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Sy "-h, -help"
.Pp
Show help message and quit.
.It Sy -config Ar path
.Pp
Path to the config file.
If unset, the default config file path is used, if any.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr soja 1 ,
.Xr sojadb 1
